      >> 3A 11 June Ft Monroe 10 Maj Eckert Wind changed to north blowing hard and drove us in without doing anything . Now seems to be clearing off 2 p. m. The operators at West Point have just discovered that their cable does not work business is now repeated there and ferried across the river the delay is not much more than that of repeating I have sent them some No 14 wire & instructed to them to set some tall poles & try to stretch it across . I think they will succeed what is to be done [unclear]with[/unclear]
